#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564368"
msgid "Apparently they're some sort of… copies of #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564708"
msgid "Alright, be careful, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nFirst head to the end of the floor where\nthe Shield is, please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565136"
msgid "…looks like these girls hold the key to\nclearing this floor. Let's try talking to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565672"
msgid "Huh? Darling.\nAre you fine with not exploring that\ngarden back there?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566320"
msgid "She lacks any aura of life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566760"
msgid "…what is going on here?\nShe's not breathing, but her soul still\nlingers in her body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566848"
msgid "…I don't like the smell of her.\nIt's like she's an embalmed, stuffed animal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567032"
msgid "…#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF.\nShe dares show us this filth:\na living, stuffed animal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567136"
msgid "………………ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567160"
msgid "―――Wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567176"
msgid "I'm pretty sure #C120200255Alice#CDEF's lips just moved…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567400"
msgid "He, lp."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567592"
msgid "…her quartz eyes remain open,\nbut her soul is no longer here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568064"
msgid "No, I should be more direct.\n…let's save her.\nThat should surely lead to a clue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568452"
msgid "A hostile program other than #C236196003Caster#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568992"
msgid "I pick up the item that the fading monster dropped."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569044"
msgid "\nThese… are doll parts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569092"
msgid "I see. This is definitely a key item.\nIt's easy to tell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569508"
msgid "The second enemy also dropped doll parts.\nThis really does seem to be a key item."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569812"
msgid "It looks just like a small-scale #C236196003Caster#CDEF in a black dress."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570488"
msgid "Good morning, #[mister][miss]# meddlesome.\nSo, you made #C120200255Alice#CDEF's wish come true."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571696"
msgid "#RUBS     I am #RUBE#C255045045Alice#CDEF is#REND a defeated Servant.\n#RUBS     I am #RUBE#C120200255Alice#CDEF is#REND a wandering specter.\nEverything is but a fleeting dream to #RUBS   us#RUBE#C120200255Alice#CDEF#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571928"
msgid "Ahh, but―――an evil witch caught us.\nWe ended up making friends with a mean person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572680"
msgid "\"Doesn't trust other people's hearts,\" huh?\nThat #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF. She's no enthusiast,\nbut a collector, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572816"
msgid "Yes. #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF despises humans.\nYet, she loves humans who don't move."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573320"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF's body is disintegrating…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573372"
msgid "What!? I thought she was going to be saved…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574880"
msgid "#C236196003Nursery Rhyme#CDEF―――\nShe supported her lonely reader until\nthe very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575340"
msgid "…led by #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's words, I take the #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

